---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import GuideLink from "../../components/GuideLink.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Enshrouded Guides: 1.0 Spells, Sparkworks and Skill Tree"
  description="Enshrouded guides — 1.0 release details, all 9 new spells, the Sparkworks logic system and the skill tree reset, plus database walkthroughs."
>
  <h1>Enshrouded Guides</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Practical guides for Enshrouded, starting with the 1.0 full release on October 15, 2026. Everything
    below is written from confirmed information and updated as the game changes.
  </p>

  <h2>Enshrouded 1.0</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <GuideLink
      title="1.0 Release: Date, Platforms and Everything New"
      desc="October 15, 2026 on PC and PS5. Level cap 50, gear 55, new biome, save compatibility and the full confirmed change list."
      href="/guides/enshrouded-1-0-release/"
      badge="1.0"
    />
    <GuideLink
      title="All 9 New Spells and Summons"
      desc="Mana Drain, Entangle, Pillar of Flames, Blizzard, Ball Lightning and the new summons category, plus 22 tier-7 Eternal spells."
      href="/guides/enshrouded-1-0-new-spells/"
      badge="1.0"
    />
    <GuideLink
      title="Skill Tree Reset and New Skills"
      desc="Why the tree resets, the 8 new skills, and how to spend your points for solo, group, boss and long-fight builds."
      href="/guides/enshrouded-1-0-skill-tree-reset/"
      badge="1.0"
    />
    <GuideLink
      title="Sparkworks: Levers, Plates and Logic Gates"
      desc="Wire triggers to doors, traps and enemy spawns, then publish the result with Adventure Sharing and Share Codes."
      href="/guides/enshrouded-1-0-sparkworks/"
      badge="1.0"
    />
  </div>

  <h2>Database</h2>
  <p class="muted">
    Looking for specific numbers rather than a walkthrough? Every item, weapon, armour piece and
    consumable in the game is searchable in the
    <a href="/database/">Enshrouded database</a>, with stat tables for
    <a href="/weapons/">weapons</a>, <a href="/armor/">armour</a> and
    <a href="/consumables/">consumables</a>, plus the
    <a href="/materials-calculator/">materials calculator</a> and
    <a href="/rankings/">rankings</a>.
  </p>
</Base>
